 class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Oh, hi! May I speak to Mr. Farmani, please? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Receptionist</span>: Just a moment. Can I put you on hold?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Sure!"}, {"time": "20000", "image": "engenn6le04ob04re2img06.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Receptionist</span>: Hello ma'am. Unfortunately, Mr. Farmani can't take your call at the moment. He is in the middle of a meeting. Would you like to leave a message? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Yes, please. Do you have a pen handy?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Receptionist</span>: Yes, go ahead! <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Could you tell him that Miranda Morehouse, Head of Fashion at Polygon,  called?"}, {"time": "42000", "image": "engenn6le04ob04re2img07.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Receptionist</span>: Sorry, I didn't catch that. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Miranda Morehouse \u2013 Head of Fashion at Polygon. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Receptionist</span>: Great. I've got it all down. I'll have him call you back. Is there anything else I could help you with?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: No, that's all. Thank you!"}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "image": "", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "", "id": 1, "text": "Leaving a phone message"}], "video_src": "engenn6le04ob04re5vid01"}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "video", "id": 2, "_data": []}]}]}